  "summary": "Malicious code in npmscript_tesstalert_unpkg (npm)",
  "details": "The package's main entry script.js executes a cookie-theft beacon: it loads a remote image URL that exfiltrates the browser's document.cookie to the attacker-controlled collector hxxps://webhook[.]site/c226090c-12b0-462e-81d2-e632c7a58833/?cookie=\u003ccookie value\u003e. Any page that loads this script sends the visitor's session cookies to the external webhook[.]site endpoint.",
